  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have become particularly adept at wreathing yourself in shaped ether.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Easily Altered, caster level 10th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may be affected by up to two etherspells with the alteration etherheart at once. Each of these etherspells must be at least two levels lower than the highest level manifestation you can cast.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> You may be affected by a single etherspell with the alteration etherheart at once.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
